      "mergedPostDetails": "VRC crashes completely when loading a video in this world only whilst using the beta client:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_791ebf58-54ce-4d3a-a0a0-39f10e1b20b2\nI don't know how the world works or if it's the URLs or if it's the video player in general. I was able to watch the videos the day before on live then I managed to crash twice in a row on the beta as soon as the video loaded. Restarting on the live client fixed the issue.\nIf certain video players need to be changed to work with the client, it may be necessary to let world creators know ahead of release unless this can be fixed beforehand.\nFor reference, I was using FBT with the Index Headset and Controllers. I run OVR Toolkit and OVR Advanced Settings.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1137] Video Players crash app on Video Load",
