      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Could you please provide more detail?\nIn particular, we're interested in the output logs of when you run into this problem.\nYour output logs are stored in `C:\\Users\\USERNAME\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat`. They're text files, and they're named `output_log_HH-MM-SS.txt`. The time stamp shows the time at which that log started, so make sure you give us the right one.\nIt's a hidden folder, so you might have some problems tracking it down. Try pasting this into your Windows File Explorer address bar: `%AppData\\..\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat`.\nYou can paste the contents of the **newest file** into [pastebin](https://pastebin.com), [gist](https://gist.github.com/), [0bin](https://0bin.net/), or a similar service. Paste that link as a response to this thread. Please make sure it is the latest file that only has you reproducing the issue in it!!\nIf you aren't comfortable posting your output log here, please [send our Support Team a ticket](https://help.vrchat.com), attach the text file, and provide a link to this issue report.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
