      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I saw some report regarding this on open beta channel and Merlin's discord server earlier.\nBasically normal Video Load fail error but it just fail or crash people depends on case. (Need to check further to confirm dividing point.)\nIt currently only happen with Merlin's U# Video Player of video player using specific logic. (as Merlin said.)\nPS: I try to locate screenshot posted earlier but cannot locate at this time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
