      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had a crashed video player when switching to the beta client. However, I identified the bug that caused a variable to become null due to how the initialization order is changed, placed a check for that and now my video player works in both normal and beta versions.\nSo video player works fine, but the logic code that worked previously may have got broken in the new version. It just needs to be identified and corrected by the creator.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
