      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The migration from youtube-dl to yt-dlp is complete, but some UDON scripting issues seem to be causing problems with the video player behavior.\nIn the world using the iwasyncVideo player, the UI script is not working properly and the video is not playing.\nThis world is a good example of the problem in that it uses the iwasync player and makes heavy use of playlists.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0b1f46c5-f60b-46c1-94e1-7880ac988901\nI think something is broken in the behavior.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
